 hell, and protect Lucic and the world from his wrath.", "summary": "Back to the past with the Devils game. Commodore 64 game on your PC! Devils is an arcade-logic game with rpg elements created in the retro atmosphere of C64 computers. It was created using 16 colors known from Commodore 64. The game is available in two language versions: Polish and English. As a real arcade game it includes high scores with two categories to compete: Fastest Time (saved at end of game) and Max Score (saved at end of each lvl).", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 41, "name": "4X (explore, expand, exploit, and exterminate)"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/devils-the-boruta-revenge", "videos": [{"id": 204225, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "4oVvZ0asH2Q", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4oVvZ0asH2Q", "title": "DEVILS: THE BORUTA REVENGE HIGHLIGHT", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4oVvZ0asH2Q/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "game_localizations": [{"id": 64493, "region": {"id": 4, "name": "Europe", "category": "continent", "identifier": "EU"}}]}